  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p>Hi all，</p><p>【映客527】活动已上线，活动时间2026年5月15日-5月27日，现同步活动Day13数据。</p><p><strong class=\"font-semibold\">一、完成情况：</strong></p><p>活动目标：活动钻石消耗达2.16e钻石</p><p>目标完成度：活动消耗达12128万钻石，目标完成度为56.15%</p><table class=\"wrapped\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 104.0pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 114.4pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 104.0pt;\" /><col /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>目标</td><td>消耗</td><td>完成度</td><td>日期进度</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>216,000,000</td><td>121,281,590</td><td>56.15%</td><td>100.00%</td></tr></tbody></table><p>活动消耗占比大盘消耗的24.71%，专属礼物消耗占比大盘礼物消耗的43.32%；</p><p>其中普通礼物消耗9045万钻，非礼物消耗979万钻，特殊礼物消耗2104万钻。</p><table class=\"wrapped\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 145.6pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 104.0pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 114.4pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 104.0pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 119.6pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 98.8pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 62.4pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 109.2pt;\" /><col /><col /><col /><col /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>日期</td><td>总消耗</td><td>礼物消耗</td><td>功能消耗</td><td>活动合计</td><td>礼物墙消耗</td><td>非礼物消耗</td><td>特殊礼物消耗</td><td>活动礼物消耗</td><td>活动礼物占比</td><td>专属礼物占大盘礼物</td><td>活动占大盘比</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>20260515&nbsp;</td><td>40,100,727</td><td>22,283,652</td><td>17,817,075</td><td>8,677,857</td><td>6,463,389</td><td>0.00%</td><td>2,214,468</td><td>8,677,857</td><td>21.64%</td><td>38.94%</td><td>21.64%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>20260516&nbsp;</td><td>35,911,762</td><td>18,824,800</td><td>17,086,962</td><td>9,154,305</td><td>6,017,237</td><td>1,562,638</td><td>1,574,430</td><td>7,591,667</td><td>21.14%</td><td>40.33%</td><td>25.49%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>20260517&nbsp;</td><td>32,181,754</td><td>13,989,902</td><td>18,191,852</td><td>6,550,287</td><td>4,096,594</td><td>1,475,243</td><td>978,450</td><td>5,075,044</td><td>15.77%</td><td>36.28%